ure Park","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon: 801 S. Patterson Ave.","notes":"Make the sculpture grounds a daylight walk: view the outdoor works and use the visit to learn where the museum will reopen after renovations.","short_summary":"Year-round outdoor sculpture grounds beside Miami’s art museum.","evidence_claim":"Miami states that the museum’s sculpture park is open year-round while its galleries are closed for renovation through Fall 2027.","source_url":"https://miamioh.edu/cca/art-museum/","source_title":"Richard and Carole Cocks Art Museum","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The galleries are closed for renovations through Fall 2027; Miami identifies the Sculpture Park as open year-round.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"goggin-ice-center-public-skating","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Public skating at Goggin Ice Center","title":"Check a public-skating session at Goggin","subtitle":"Saturday evening: 610 S. Oak St.","notes":"Look up the current public-skate schedule, register if required, and invite a small group for an activity that does not depend on a campus organization.","short_summary":"An ice-center activity at Miami’s two-rink recreation facility.","evidence_claim":"Miami lists public skating among Goggin Ice Center’s recreational opportunities and provides a public-skate registration link.","source_url":"https://miamioh.edu/athletics-recreation/goggin-ice-center/","source_title":"Goggin Ice Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Public-skate availability is schedule-dependent; use Goggin’s current facility schedule and registration information before heading over.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"recreational-sports-center-climbing-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Climbing Center at the Recreational Sports Center","title":"Try the Climbing Center","subtitle":"Sunday: Recreational Sports Center, 750 S. Oak St.","notes":"If you have facility access, check the Climbing Center’s current schedule and try the bouldering cave or ask about an introductory climbing option.","short_summary":"A campus recreation climbing space with beginner and ongoing programs.","evidence_claim":"Miami says its Climbing Center offers equipment rentals, Climbing Fundamentals, a Lead Series class, and a free bouldering cave.","source_url":"https://miamioh.edu/athletics-recreation/recreation/facilities/recreational-sports-center.html","source_title":"Recreational Sports Center | Miami Recreation","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Facility access and climbing activities may have separate requirements; verify current facility hours and program details with Miami Recreation.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"silvoor-biological-sanctuary","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Silvoor Biological Sanctuary","title":"Take a daylight walk at Silvoor","subtitle":"Sunday afternoon: 910 Silvoor Lane, Oxford","notes":"Choose a daylight walk and stay on the route; use the sanctuary’s trail information to notice the wildflower garden and the changing seasonal landscape.","short_summary":"A named natural-area sanctuary with a wildflower garden and trail access.","evidence_claim":"Miami describes Silvoor Biological Sanctuary as a 2.5-acre tract with an extensive wildflower garden and gives its entrance as 910 Silvoor Lane.","source_url":"https://miamioh.edu/life-at-miami/natural-areas/places-to-visit/","source_title":"Places to Visit | Miami University Natural Areas","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use the official trail map and visit in daylight; the Natural Areas prohibit fires, hunting, bicycling, and camping.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"millett-hall","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Millett Hall","title":"Look for a game or performance at Millett Hall","subtitle":"Weekend closer: 500 E. Sycamore St.","notes":"Check Miami’s current calendar for an all-ages game, assembly, or performance, then use the building as a recognizable campus landmark on your route.","short_summary":"A large campus arena used for RedHawk basketball and university performances.","evidence_claim":"Miami identifies Millett Hall as the home of Miami RedHawk basketball and a site for university assemblies and performances.","source_url":"https://miamioh.edu/cca/performing-arts-series/visit-us/","source_title":"Visit Us | Miami University Performing Arts Series","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Attendance and admission depend on the specific scheduled event; confirm event details, ticketing, and parking before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
